==Battleground==
*30 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*30 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is trivialized by [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]] as long as you've collected all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 & 2, as well as one from Chapter 3. Given good enough meatshielding, the enemies stand no chance against your anti-Alien firepower.

